file: macros/src/block.rs
breaks: A method of an inherent `#[dispatch]` block that cannot be forwarded is reported under its own `#[cfg]`, so a build that compiles it out reports nothing, as `docs/limits.md` says.
expect: killed
witness: s1=none path=inherent-some item=cfg-off

find:
                report(&cfgs, error);
replace:
                report(&cfgs[..0], error);
